I recently discovered that the 6pack module will not resynsc when the 
TNC loses power and is brought back up. The only way to get the TNC back 
on line is to reboot. As far as I can tell this is true all the way back 
to the 2.6.19 kernel and extends thru 2.6.24.

Has anyone else  seen this behavior?
Is there a fix?

